WEBVTT

00:13:59.051 --> 00:14:02.700
And in other ways,
and the most important ways,

00:14:02.724 --> 00:14:03.912
it's a team.

00:14:03.936 --> 00:14:06.645
And if you think I'm a badass,
you want to meet Bonnie.

00:14:06.669 --> 00:14:08.121
(Laughter)

00:14:08.145 --> 00:14:09.403
Bonnie, where are you?

00:14:10.741 --> 00:14:12.014
Where are you?

00:14:13.236 --> 00:14:14.615
There's Bonnie Stoll.

00:14:14.639 --> 00:14:17.026
(Applause)

00:14:17.050 --> 00:14:18.344
My buddy.

00:14:18.368 --> 00:14:21.373
(Applause)

00:14:21.397 --> 00:14:23.717
The Henry David Thoreau quote goes,

00:14:23.741 --> 00:14:27.011
"When you achieve your dreams,
it's not so much what you get

00:14:27.035 --> 00:14:29.333
as who you have become in achieving them."

00:14:29.904 --> 00:14:31.815
And yeah, I stand before you now.